/**
 * components/shared/PaymentsPage.js: campaign invoices + creator payouts.
 *
 * The single editor of record for every campaign invoice field (the campaign Invoice tab is
 * read-only and deep-links here). Two-stage money flow per campaign: invoice agency to Patrick
 * (invoices row), then payout Patrick to creator (creator_payouts + payout_splits).
 * campaign_id XOR reward_entry_id says which side a row belongs to; this is the campaign side.
 *
 * Renders components/shared/PayoutForm.js with parent={kind:'campaign'} for the payout half.
 * Used by AdminDashboard, and read-only by CreatorDashboard / MobilePostPage.
 *
 * @invariant editable invoice fields mirror the DB lock triggers via
 *            components/shared/InvoiceLock.js. Never reintroduce inline JE-probe regexes or
 *            lock UI.
 * @gotcha the payout_splits to payment_destinations embed has TWO FKs; always use
 *         PAYOUT_SPLIT_DESTINATION_EMBED or the whole query fails silently with PGRST201.
 * @see docs/MONEY.md (invoices, Patterns A to F), docs/CODEBASE.md
 */
